Corrected the supported devices and TCP/IP protocols tables: added Fortigate's scan and pull support (SSH, HTTPS), added OpenPLCv4 (HTTPS on port 8443), added HTTPS for the SEL RTACs and scanning for the GE devices, removed ControlLogix from HTTPS, and removed the push claims for SCEPTRE, which can't push. These tables are now checked against the module metadata by tests. Documented listing module capabilities and selecting modules by protocol in the operation docs, and describing a module's capabilities in the module developer guide.
